    metaDescription: "CPO licensing requirements explained layer by layer: energy supplier licensing, dedicated CPO licences like Portugal's, and the six-layer stack from corporate and electrical to metrology, driver-facing rules, payments, and tax.",
    tags: ["CPO licensing requirements", "CPO licence", "regulation", "metrology", "Eichrecht", "AFIR", "charging infrastructure"],
