    published: true,
    metaTitle: "White Label Payment Processing for EV Charging | NetworkCore",
    metaDescription: "White label payment processing lets platforms accept charging payments under their own brand. NetworkCore offers it as one piece of a deeper settlement and clearing layer: split logic, wallet management, compliance, and fast settlement.",
