    metaDescription: "The EV charging commission model: how Distribution Partners turn convenient access to public charging into a new revenue stream, with programmable, negotiable commissions per CPO relationship.",
    tags: ["EV Charging Commission Model", "Distribution Partners", "Programmable Commission", "Roaming"],
